1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Two models can earn the same pretraining score and still end up in very different places.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Think of training as moving through a landscape.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Nexus cares about whether task valleys agree.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Instead of guessing that agreement directly, Nexus uses a temporary inner model: clone, step on batches,.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Pretraining loss is a scorecard.
